BUGS DIRECTORY (tam-ring)

This folder keeps track of bugs -- both in our own implementation of
tam-ring and in the ecosystem/reference projects we track through the
ideas/ directory.

Tracking bugs from upstream and peer projects (along with how they were
diagnosed and solved) helps us stay aware of subtle edge cases, failure
modes, and regressions that other implementations encounter so we can check
for similar bugs in our own code.

Suggested entries:

- Local bugs: Defects found in our implementation, reproduction steps,
  root cause, and fix or status.
- Ecosystem bugs: Notable bugs and fixes from reference projects tracked in
  ideas/, with notes on whether tam-ring shares the same risk or pattern.
